usage: narrative_batch_configured.py [--llm-config LLM_CONFIG]
                                     [--llm-provider {minimax,mimo,deepseek,openai}]
                                     [--allow-local-model-http]

Compose the finite batch CLI with the project's existing LLM config loader.

options:
  --llm-config LLM_CONFIG
  --llm-provider {minimax,mimo,deepseek,openai}
  --allow-local-model-http
usage: narrative_batch_configured.py [-h] --project-root PROJECT_ROOT
                                     --catalog-config CATALOG_CONFIG
                                     --automation-db AUTOMATION_DB
                                     --work-dir WORK_DIR --request REQUEST

Process explicit source references without translation

options:
